eta Tags in SEO? All Meta Tags Explained<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Website Reports<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>This SEO project for beginners entails creating and evaluating analytical reports for a website to analyze its SEO health and determine its rank. Every SEO professional must be familiar with this task, which would be ideal for your portfolio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>SEO Skills:<\/strong> Reports, Writing, Editing<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Portfolio Websites<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A portfolio website demonstrates your skills by including projects you have worked on, clients&#8217; testimonials, and even information about your professional life. You should have a keyword-rich blog on the website to reach a broader <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a>, which helps you stand out.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>SEO Skills:<\/strong> Writing, Editing, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/content-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Content Marketing<\/a>, Copywriting, Programming skills<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, 